WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.754 --> 00:00:04.558
THE PRESIDENT.

00:00:03.958 --> 00:00:09.463
JENNIFER GRIFFIN TELLS US WHAT

00:00:04.692 --> 00:00:10.097
SHE IS HEARING.

00:00:09.597 --> 00:00:10.764
&gt;&gt; AT A TELEVISED CABINET

00:00:10.231 --> 00:00:13.834
MEETING, EMBATTLED VETERANS

00:00:10.898 --> 00:00:14.568
AFFAIRS SECRETARY DAVID SHULKIN

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:15.836
SWITCHED SEATS TO SIT NEXT TO

00:00:14.702 --> 00:00:16.971
THE PRESIDENT.

00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:21.375
CALLS FOR HIS REMOVAL HAVE HAD A

00:00:17.104 --> 00:00:25.112
FEVERED PITCH.

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:26.847
A SHIFT IN TONE.

00:00:25.246 --> 00:00:27.248
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY SHULKIN HAS DONE A

00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:31.785
GREAT JOB.

00:00:27.381 --> 00:00:36.523
&gt;&gt; AND INSPECTOR GENERAL REPORT

00:00:31.919 --> 00:00:37.224
REVEALED DAVID SHULKIN ACCEPTED

00:00:36.657 --> 00:00:38.425
WIMBLEDON TICKETS.

00:00:37.358 --> 00:00:39.159
THE INSPECTOR GENERAL IS

00:00:38.559 --> 00:00:42.029
INVESTIGATING WHETHER HIS

00:00:39.293 --> 00:00:42.896
SECURITY DETAIL WAS MADE TO RUN

00:00:42.162 --> 00:00:45.599
PERSONAL ERRANDS AND DELIVER

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:47.001
FURNITURE FROM HOME DEPOT TO

00:00:45.733 --> 00:00:49.203
SHULKIN'S HOME.

00:00:47.134 --> 00:00:49.837
THE PRESIDENT IS CONSIDERING

00:00:49.336 --> 00:00:50.704
REPLACING SHULKIN WITH

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:51.839
DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY SECRETARY

00:00:50.838 --> 00:00:53.140
RICK PERRY.

00:00:51.972 --> 00:00:54.041
TODAY PERRY TOLD REPORTERS HE'S

00:00:53.274 --> 00:00:55.209
NOT INTERESTED.

00:00:54.174 --> 00:00:58.412
&gt;&gt; I THINK RICK PERRY WOULD

00:00:55.342 --> 00:01:00.414
REALLY SHAKE THE PLACE UP.

00:00:58.545 --> 00:01:02.816
&gt;&gt; ADDING TO SHULKIN'S HEADACHES

00:01:00.547 --> 00:01:04.018
IS A GENERATIONAL DIVIDE AMONG

00:01:02.950 --> 00:01:05.853
VETERANS GROUPS.

00:01:04.151 --> 00:01:07.154
THOSE SERIOUSLY INJURED FROM THE

00:01:05.986 --> 00:01:09.089
IRAQ AND AFGHAN WARS WANT THE VA

00:01:07.288 --> 00:01:11.292
TO MOVE FASTER TOWARDS GIVING

00:01:09.223 --> 00:01:11.759
THE VETS THE CHOICE OF SEEING

00:01:11.425 --> 00:01:15.629
PRIVATE DOCTORS.

00:01:11.892 --> 00:01:16.497
&gt;&gt; THIS IS A GENERATIONAL ISSUE.

00:01:15.763 --> 00:01:18.899
YOUNG VETERANS DON'T UNDERSTAND

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.034
WHY WE NEED TO DRIVE 30 MILES TO

00:01:19.033 --> 00:01:21.802
GET A PERCEPTION FIELD WHEN WE

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:22.903
HAVE A PERFECTLY SUITABLE

00:01:21.935 --> 00:01:25.139
PHARMACY TWO BLOCKS AWAY.

00:01:23.037 --> 00:01:26.707
&gt;&gt; TRADITIONAL VETERANS GROUPS

00:01:25.272 --> 00:01:28.208
HAVE COME TO SHULKIN'S DEFENSE

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:30.444
AND WORRY THAT THE PRESIDENT'S

00:01:28.342 --> 00:01:30.711
SUPPORTERS WANT TO PRIVATIZE THE

00:01:30.577 --> 00:01:33.247
VA.

00:01:30.844 --> 00:01:35.282
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY SHULKIN HAS DONE A

00:01:33.380 --> 00:01:38.218
GOOD JOB.

00:01:35.416 --> 00:01:38.552
LEGISLATION PASSED AND PROGRAMS

00:01:38.352 --> 00:01:41.422
CREATED.

00:01:38.686 --> 00:01:42.823
I WOULD BE SAD TO SEE HIM GO.

00:01:41.555 --> 00:01:43.424
&gt;&gt; SECRETARY SHULKIN IS AN OBAMA

00:01:42.956 --> 00:01:45.326
HOLDOVER.

00:01:43.557 --> 00:01:46.760
HE RECEIVED 100 VOTES DURING HIS

00:01:45.459 --> 00:01:47.695
SENATE CONFIRMATION HEARING AND

00:01:46.894 --> 00:01:48.062
WAS ONCE A FAVORITE OF THE

00:01:47.828 --> 00:01:50.597
PRESIDENT.

